    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Browser = SocialChannelsPage + socialService + Axios (/collaborator/profile?tab=social; also WalletPage). Initial GET is omitted. JWT runs before controller; DTO checks platform, integer followers >= 0 and boolean primary. No RolesGuard or KYC gate is bound here.",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 2595,
      "w": 2750,
      "h": 44,
      "size": 19,
      "align": "left",
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Expanded path adds a new primary channel. If isPrimary is false, skip clearing old flags. Multiple channels on one platform are allowed; no count cap or unique URL/platform constraint is defined. Followers are entered manually; no OAuth/platform follower lookup or channel-ownership verification runs.",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 2645,
      "w": 2750,
      "h": 44,
      "size": 19,
      "align": "left",
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Profile total is recalculated using SUM over all owned rows after add/delete; absent profile is not created (updateMany count 0). Channel, primary reset and aggregate/profile writes are separate, not a transaction. A later failure can leave earlier writes committed; concurrent calls do not guarantee one primary.",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 2700,
      "w": 2750,
      "h": 44,
      "size": 19,
      "align": "left",
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "DELETE /social-channels/:id and PATCH /:id/primary read the channel, return 404 if absent or 403 for another owner. Delete is permanent, recalculates totals and does not choose a replacement primary. setPrimary clears old flags then marks the selected row; general URL/follower editing has no endpoint here.",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 2755,
      "w": 2750,
      "h": 44,
      "size": 19,
      "align": "left",
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "UI offers TikTok, Facebook, YouTube, Instagram, Threads and Zalo; the API enum also accepts Telegram, Shopee Video, Lemon8 and Other. First-row display fallback is not a stored primary flag. Channel rows reference User; no Profile-to-channel foreign key exists. Duplicate rows can double-count followers.",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 2810,
      "w": 2750,
      "h": 44,
      "size": 19,
      "align": "left",
      "bold": false
    }
  ]
}